{"id":"699918fd54cc2a8e","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-field-extension.md","title":"Field Extension","display":"df-field-extension — Field Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-field-extension","aliases":["58-df-field-extension","Field Extension"],"display":"df-field-extension — Field Extension","depends_on":["[[58-df-field]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-field-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-field-extension</span><span>Field Extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-field-extension — Field Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K/k\">\\(K/k\\)</span> (extension field over its base field)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V\">\\(k,K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V\\)</span> (field carriers and operations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S\\)</span> (explicit structure predicate and carrier-level compatibility projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}extension\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(K,k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land k\\subseteq K\\land0_k=0_K\\land1_k=1_K\\land\\forall a,b\\in k\\;(a+_k b=a+_K b\\land a\\cdot_k b=a\\cdot_K b)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}extension\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(K,k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land k\\subseteq K\\land0_k=0_K\\land1_k=1_K\\land\\forall a,b\\in k\\;(a+_k b=a+_K b\\land a\\cdot_k b=a\\cdot_K b)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}extension\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(K,k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}extension\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(K,k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The argument order is extension first, base second. The compatibility form existentially binds the operations instead of using free decorated symbols.</li>\n<li>Degree: dimension as vector space; multiplicative for towers <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[K:k][L:K] = [L:k]\">\\([K:k][L:K] = [L:k]\\)</span></li>\n<li>Algebraic closure: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{k}\">\\(\\bar{k}\\)</span> algebraic over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>; unique up to isomorphism (AC)</li>\n<li>Galois: normal + separable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{Gal}(K/k)| = [K:k]\">\\(|\\operatorname{Gal}(K/k)| = [K:k]\\)</span>; fundamental theorem</li>\n<li>Degree and algebraicity are downstream atoms built from field extensions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Artin, Algebra</li>\n<li>Lang, Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k,K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V$ (field carriers and operations, see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field predicate, see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K/k","display":false},{"tex":"k,K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}extension\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(K,k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land k\\subseteq K\\land0_k=0_K\\land1_k=1_K\\land\\forall a,b\\in k\\;(a+_k b=a+_K b\\land a\\cdot_k b=a\\cdot_K b)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}extension\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(K,k,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":true},{"tex":"[K:k][L:K] = [L:k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{k}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\implies","display":false},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{Gal}(K/k)| = [K:k]","display":false}],"bytes":1825,"backlinks":[{"id":"b6b0fdef2692e665","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}$ 取 [[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"65457a1980798fce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (extension first, base second; see [[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]])"},{"id":"3a6ab09b3579e778","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ee0e6fd2a5876cee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"278b9d6853499788","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S$ (field-extension predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]])"},{"id":"9197104486eef137","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dac0596ff0a0af4a","anchor